      "target": {
        "function": "mainpositionTV",
        "callee": "luaS_hashlongstr"
      },
      "question": "In target.exe, one function returns the hash of a long string, computing it the first time it is needed and remembering it in the string. Exactly one other function calls it directly. Give the address where that calling function starts."
    },
